OL,3,GNEWSACounter-terror police lead
OL,4,Ainvestigation into major incident near
OL,5,ARAF base, officials say
OL,6,
OL,7,FCounter-terror police are leading the
OL,8,Finvestigation after several men were
OL,9,Farrested on suspicion of offences under
OL,10,Fthe Explosives Act
OL,12,FResidents in the village of Whelford,
OL,13,Fnear the base, have been evacuated -
OL,14,Fwhat we know so far
OL,16,FA police conference which was due to
OL,17,Fstart at 12:45 BST is delayed - watch
OL,18,Flive footage from the scene above
OL,20,F"It all happened very quickly. We just
OL,21,Fpacked our stuff up and came here,"
OL,22,Fsays one of the evacuated residents
