OL,6,
OL,7,FHelicopter footage shows robots
OL,8,Fapproaching vans at the scene as a
OL,9,FBritish Army bomb disposal team is
OL,10,Fcarrying out operations
OL,12,FRAF Fairford has long been used as a
OL,13,Fforward operating location by the US
OL,14,Fmilitary. The country's Air Force says
OL,15,Fit "remains vigilant" following the
OL,16,Fincident
